---
import { CONTACT } from '../consts';
---

<section id="contact" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-600 via-brand-500 to-amber-500">
	<div class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 -left-20 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-3xl"></div>
	<div class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-28 -right-16 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-amber-200/20 blur-3xl"></div>

	<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-20 text-center md:py-24">
		<h2 class="reveal text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
			더 미루지 마시고, 오늘 한 번 이야기해 보세요.
		</h2>
		<p class="reveal mt-5 text-lg text-white/90">
			전화 한 통이면 됩니다. 지금 가게 상황을 듣고, 무엇부터 하면 좋을지 알려 드리겠습니다.
		</p>

		<div class="reveal mt-10 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
			<a
				href={CONTACT.phoneHref}
				class="rounded-2xl bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base font-bold text-brand-700 shadow-xl shadow-ink-900/10 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-cream-50"
			>
				📞 {CONTACT.phone}
			</a>
			<a
				href={CONTACT.emailHref}
				class="rounded-2xl border border-white/50 px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white/15"
			>
				✉️ 이메일로 문의하기
			</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
